# Vendored tiktoken BPE ranks (FIX-012). These bytes must reach disk exactly
# as committed: tiktoken checks them against a pinned SHA-256 and, on a
# mismatch, DELETES the cache file and re-fetches it over the network. Any
# end-of-line normalisation (core.autocrlf, a `* text=auto` rule added later)
# would change the hash, so opt the directory out of text handling entirely.
# In .gitattributes the LAST matching line wins, so a broad `* text=auto`
# must go ABOVE this rule; `test_tiktoken_vendored` asks git for the
# effective attribute (`git check-attr`) and fails if it is not `unset`.
# `-diff` keeps a 1.6 MB rank table out of `git diff` / `git log -p`.
backend/app/data/tiktoken/* -text -diff
